# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
# Filleted octagonal cylinder: X axis, maximum radius 1, length 2, centered at the origin.
# 90 vertices and 176 triangles; outward winding, no smooth normals.
# Two straight axial segments and eight triangles per centered flat cap.
# Each cap-side rim has a radius-0.1 fillet sampled with four quarter-circle segments.
# Fillet radius is measured in the plane normal to each octagonal side face.
# Straight sides span X = -0.9 to 0.9; cap circumradius is 1 - 0.1/cos(pi/8).
# Nonuniform scaling also scales the fillet profile; volume is smaller than the sharp base.
o cylinder_x_8sides_2segments_filleted
